===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|statistics|lang=en}} Any of the ninety-nine [[point]]s that divide an [[ordered]] [[distribution]] into one hundred parts, each containing one [[per cent]] of the [[population]].
# {{context|statistics|lang=en}} Any one of the hundred groups so divided.
#: ''He is highly intelligent – he has an IQ in the top percentile.''

